.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Verify that special characters in link labels, list items, headings and table cells are escaped
.#-----------------------------------------------------
[[x ~]~] ~[y ~~{~~{info}} *z*>>https://xwiki.org]] wow![[label>>https://xwiki.org]]

[[x ~]~] ~[y ~~{~~{info}} *z* & &amp; ~| \*>>Page]]

* ~# item
* ~- item
* 1. item

= a ~{~{info}} ~# =

|~- a|~# b

> ~# quote

; ~# term
: ~- definition
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
[x \]\] \[y \{{info}} \*z\*](https://xwiki.org) wow\![label](https://xwiki.org)

[[x \]\] \[y \{{info}} \*z\* & \&amp; &#124; \\\*|Page]]

* \# item
* \- item
* 1\. item

# a \{{info}} \#

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| - a | # b |

>  \# quote

\# term
